@StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health / List endpoints (Swagger UI is at http://localhost:5000/)

### Get all workshops
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/workshops
Accept: application/json

### Get featured workshops
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/workshops/featured
Accept: application/json

### Get all resources
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/resources
Accept: application/json

### Get featured media
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/media/featured
Accept: application/json

### Search media
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/media/search?q=nidra
Accept: application/json

### Get all collections
GET {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/collections
Accept: application/json

### Admin login (returns a JWT)
POST {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "renu@soy2024"
}

### Submit a contact message
POST {{StringsOfYoga.Api_HostAddress}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "message": "I'd like to book a workshop."
}